    },
    {
      "id": "same",
      "label": "每个线程拿到同一个行和",
      "tone": "accent"
    },
    {
      "id": "dst",
      "label": "fragment(dst)",
      "sub": "形状 [M]",
      "tone": "store"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "src",
      "to": "in_thread"
    },
    {
      "from": "in_thread",
      "to": "cross"
    },
    {
      "from": "cross",
      "to": "shared"
    },
    {
      "from": "cross",
      "to": "shuffle"
    },
    {
      "from": "shared",
      "to": "same"
    },
    {
      "from": "shuffle",
      "to": "same"
    },
    {
      "from": "same",
      "to": "dst"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "clear=True（默认）覆盖 dst；clear=False 先把 dst 拷进临时 fragment，归约完再合并一次。所以 sum/abssum 会多一份片上存储",
    "四种 scope 组合：shared→shared 建两个 fragment；shared→fragment、fragment→shared 各建一个；fragment→fragment 直发",
    "约束：threads 必须能被 scale 整除，且 threads / scale 是 2 的幂，否则 static_assert 失败"
